docs/projects/V1-IMPLEMENTATION.md:13:| Release/wire | T01 producer/consumer fix → T02 schema repair → T03 contextual decisions → T03-PRE baselines; T03-HISTORY inherited/root verification follows T03 and T04 | One writer for `release.rs`/`version.rs`; historic readers wait for T04's manifest producer changes and integrate serially with pre-state |
docs/projects/V1-IMPLEMENTATION.md:16:| Early workflows | T10-BINS binary inventory/unsupported builders → T10-AUTH native auth | Start after T03-HISTORY releases `cargo.rs`; one writer for generated `init.rs` and action execution scripts |
