docs/projects/V1-IMPLEMENTATION.md:19:T01 is the v0.9 release-path priority. Its merge permits the bot to regenerate the release PR; fresh decision/source agreement and passing CI must precede any separately authorized merge/publication. Other lanes do not automatically become v0.9 release requirements. Existing-contract fixes can run while the architectural decisions below are being reviewed.
